description "Commander Ellian Zahra

An Agressive Hybrid commander with a tactical dueling style.

^2Weapons:
- Heavy Melee
- Custom Vibro-Sword (Cyan/Purple Style Saber)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- BP-Free Jumps
-- Cripples On Hit
- Zahra's RK-3 (3)
-- 15% More Velocity/Damage/FP Drain
-- 30% Slower RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Sonic Detonator (1)
-- Cripples On Hit

^8Inventory:
- Seeker Drone

^8Attributes:
- Tarkin's Doctrine (Stat Viewer)
- Rally
- Beskar (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Dexterity (1)
- Ammo (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Anti Mindtrick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- 15% Faster Hacking

^8Abilities
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3 Weapon Out]
- Weighted Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS3 Melee]
-- Causes Cripple On Hit
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS4]
- Flipkick ^3[Contact Jump]
- Resource Dispenser (1) ^3[USE In Melee]"
